{"data":{"body":"[P2] Cap finite deadline delays at the timer limit\n\nA supplied context reporting a finite remaining time above `2 ** 31 - 1` passes the preceding guard. Node converts that timeout to 1 ms, after which this watcher rereads the long deadline and repeats, producing a continuous timer and warning loop. The existing polling and plugin deadline implementations already account for this limit. Clamp each scheduled delay to `MAX_TIMER_DELAY_MS` and add coverage for a finite deadline above it.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABDWM5Tg","finding_digest":"69c9be61ef6c9c9b4add503a6c65338f27a2b26131cc953059cdd9ccf2596d10","finding_id":"arf_v1_nhe34yppnsojwsw5ka5gyzjtr4","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.ts::watchdeadline::timer-delay-overflow","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.ts::watchdeadline::timer-delay-overflow","line":620,"observation_digest":"878e642a29d8d33017cc2503ad4ed038e51cd2263edaa3d0c1329b66d8fccdda","observation_id":"aro_v1_q6hgikrj3djtaf6meub22twqhd","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_nhe34yppnsojwsw5ka5gyzjtr4","published_at":"2026-11-10T00:17:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_sajceyzihphknqj3byfmsv6p4u","reviewed_base_sha":"d80f532428c15b451052841e5e6848d8f821d351","reviewed_head_sha":"40d39f3be6836e766bf14711357eaf8653ac7826","reviewer":"codex","start_line":619,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1202},"record_id":"art_v1_cdcsxxmnovosgv7mk3j6jnf6vc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-10T00:17:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
